# Preeminent Captain attacks; its trigger puts Elite Vanguard from hand onto
# the battlefield tapped and attacking (ChangeZone Attacking$ True,
# SpellAbilityEffect.addToCombat, SpellAbilityEffect.java:758-793, joined
# before the move as Java's search does, ChangeZoneEffect.java:1391). The
# Vanguard was never declared, so it is an unblocked attacker once blockers
# are declared and deals its 2 in the regular damage step, after the
# Captain's first-strike 2.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
queue cardchoice 2
queue attacktarget ai
resolvestack
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
firststrikedamage
advance
combatdamage
